<%- include("partials/guest-top") %>

<section class="landing">
  <p class="eyebrow">Ranked travel</p>
  <h1>Log the miles. Climb the board.</h1>
  <p class="lede landing-copy">
    Waypoint is a travel log with the same energy as a fitness rank app — except the gym is the map.
    Track distance, countries, states, and monuments. Record drives, flights, rides, and hikes.
    Check in at famous sites from a photo. Every stat feeds your score, your rank, and a global leaderboard.
  </p>
  <p class="lede landing-copy">
    Open your hub to see totals and rank progress. Log trips or record an activity. Upload a GPS photo
    to mark a monument visited. Share travel moments in Social — photos with captions, pin favorites on
    your account, and browse the feed without posting first or waiting on a daily timer.
  </p>

  <div class="landing-actions">
    <% if (typeof traveler !== "undefined" && traveler) { %>
      <a class="btn btn-wp" href="/hub">Open your hub</a>
      <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="/logout">Sign out</a>
    <% } else { %>
      <a class="btn btn-wp" href="/login">Log in</a>
      <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="/signup">Create account</a>
    <% } %>
  </div>
</section>

<%- include("partials/guest-bottom") %>
